<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;I&gt;4887.15 cannot be stored accurately as a floating-point number, which is causing your issue.&lt;/I&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Could it be that (at least part of) the problem is that the OP is expecting that &lt;c&gt;sprint("%d", 488714.999)&lt;/c&gt; will return the string &lt;c&gt;488715&lt;/c&gt; ?
&lt;br&gt;It won't:
&lt;c&gt;
C:\&gt;perl -le "print sprintf('%d', 488714.999);"
488714
&lt;/c&gt;
&lt;br&gt;Cheers,&lt;br&gt;Rob</doctext>
